# Lab 1: first scan. A few hosts, one with IPv6, an alias, and a CNAME
# that only shows up when CNAME lookups are on. Run:
#   subenum -w examples/labs/words.txt -simulate-zone examples/labs/lab1-first-scan.zone -show-records lab.example
@         A      192.0.2.1
www       A      192.0.2.10
www       AAAA   2001:db8::10
mail      A      192.0.2.20
vpn       A      192.0.2.30
jenkins   A      192.0.2.40
shop      CNAME  www
blog      CNAME  ghost-lab.example.net.
